hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1802","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Jahl ne kaha: Beshak agar main Muhammad ko Kaaba key paas namaz padhtey huey dekhun to uski gardan par paon rakkhunga. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo use karta to use farishtey pakad letey. (Bukhari: 4958)"
